		(descr "Atlas Scientific Dissolved Oxygen OEM (OEM-DO) - 10-pad castellated carrier, 12 x 11 mm. Pads: 1 SDA, 2 NC, 3 VCC, 4 PRB, 5 PRB_GND, 6 GND, 7 INT, 8 SCL, 9 NC, 10 NC. Geometry copied from the sens1 pH OEM footprint (Atlas OEM Footprint.dxf); the DO OEM datasheet v3.5 p6/p32 gives the same 12 x 11 mm body, 11.9 mm row centres, 2.3 mm pitch and pad layout. No vias or exposed copper under the module (datasheet p31). Note: pad pitch 2.2/2.3 mm as in the Atlas DXF used for sens1; datasheet nominal is 2.3 mm.")
